{%- comment -%}
  Single Product: Exact Customer Reviews Section from Amazon Listing
  File: sections/menvel-reviews.liquid
{%- endcomment -%}

<section id="MenvelReviews" class="menvel-reviews py-16 sm:py-24 bg-white border-b border-[#EADFCF]" role="region" aria-label="Customer Reviews">
  <div class="menvel-container">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14">
      <span class="menvel-eyebrow">Real Verified Customers</span>
      <h2 class="menvel-heading-lg text-[#1F1B17]">
        Customer Reviews & Ratings
      </h2>
      
      <!-- Exact Rating Summary Bar -->
      <div class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-5 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F2E9] border border-[#EADFCF]">
        <div class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#1F1B17]">4.5</div>
        <div class="text-left">
          <div class="flex text-[#D97706] text-lg">★★★★½</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#655E56] font-semibold mt-0.5">4.5 out of 5 stars (47 global ratings)</p>
          <div class="flex gap-2 text-[10px] text-[#8A5428] font-bold mt-1">
            <span>5 Star (79%)</span>
            <span>•</span>
            <span>4 Star (8%)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Review Highlight Pills -->
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-[#1F1B17]">
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#F8F2E9] border border-[#EADFCF]">Quality (16)</span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#F8F2E9] border border-[#EADFCF]">Appearance (15)</span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#F8F2E9] border border-[#EADFCF]">Craftsmanship (7)</span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#F8F2E9] border border-[#EADFCF]">Functionality (6)</span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#F8F2E9] border border-[#EADFCF]">Protection (6)</span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#F8F2E9] border border-[#EADFCF]">Foldability (5)</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Exact Customer Reviews Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Review 1: Diverse Woodworking, LLC -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F2E9] border border-[#EADFCF] shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-3">
            <div class="flex text-[#D97706] text-sm">★★★★★</div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-[#15803D] bg-green-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">✓ Verified Purchase</span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-serif text-base font-bold text-[#1F1B17] mb-2">“Beautiful, Functional, and Well Made”</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#655E56] leading-relaxed">
            I was pleasantly surprised by the quality of this trivet set. The black walnut wood has a beautiful finish, and the craftsmanship is excellent. They feel solid and durable while still being lightweight enough to move around the kitchen with ease. The included stand keeps everything organized and easy to grab!
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-[#EADFCF] flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
          <span class="font-bold text-[#1F1B17]">Diverse Woodworking, LLC</span>
          <span class="text-[#8C827A]">July 9, 2026</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Review 2: Iuliia Nishchenko -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F2E9] border border-[#EADFCF] shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-3">
            <div class="flex text-[#D97706] text-sm">★★★★★</div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-[#15803D] bg-green-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">✓ Verified Purchase</span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-serif text-base font-bold text-[#1F1B17] mb-2">“Beautiful and practical”</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#655E56] leading-relaxed">
            This wooden Christmas tree trivet is both beautiful and practical. The design is unique and adds a cozy holiday touch to my kitchen and dining table. It protects surfaces from hot dishes really well, and the wood feels sturdy and well-made. Great quality and a perfect gift idea!
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-[#EADFCF] flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
          <span class="font-bold text-[#1F1B17]">Iuliia Nishchenko</span>
          <span class="text-[#8C827A]">August 4, 2026</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Review 3: Brian P. (Vine Customer Review) -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F2E9] border border-[#EADFCF] shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-3">
            <div class="flex text-[#D97706] text-sm">★★★★☆</div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-[#8A5428] bg-amber-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">✓ Vine Voice Review</span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-serif text-base font-bold text-[#1F1B17] mb-2">“Beautiful & conversation starter”</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#655E56] leading-relaxed">
            The black walnut wood is beautiful with a warm, rich appearance. The foldable design is probably my favorite feature. Each trivet can be opened when I need a larger surface for hot pots, casseroles, or teapot and folded back down. The tree shape is an instant conversation starter!
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-[#EADFCF] flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
          <span class="font-bold text-[#1F1B17]">Brian P.</span>
          <span class="text-[#8C827A]">August 16, 2026</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Review 4: Iana Odesskaia -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F2E9] border border-[#EADFCF] shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-3">
            <div class="flex text-[#D97706] text-sm">★★★★★</div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-[#15803D] bg-green-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">✓ Verified Purchase</span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-serif text-base font-bold text-[#1F1B17] mb-2">“Works Perfectly and Looks Great”</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#655E56] leading-relaxed">
            This product is very well made. Everything is smooth and even, and the folding mechanism works perfectly every time. It’s easy to use, easy to store, and most importantly, it really protects surfaces from hot dishes and cookware. Very happy with it!
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-[#EADFCF] flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
          <span class="font-bold text-[#1F1B17]">Iana Odesskaia</span>
          <span class="text-[#8C827A]">June 5, 2026</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Review 5: Daniil -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F2E9] border border-[#EADFCF] shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-3">
            <div class="flex text-[#D97706] text-sm">★★★★★</div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-[#15803D] bg-green-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">✓ Verified Purchase</span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-serif text-base font-bold text-[#1F1B17] mb-2">“Design and functional”</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#655E56] leading-relaxed">
            Such a unique and clever piece! When folded, it looks like a beautiful wooden tree that serves as great kitchen decor. When unfolded, it becomes a sturdy, reliable trivet. The black walnut wood quality is excellent and smooth to the touch.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-[#EADFCF] flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
          <span class="font-bold text-[#1F1B17]">Daniil</span>
          <span class="text-[#8C827A]">June 30, 2026</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Review 6: Александра Рогачева -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F2E9] border border-[#EADFCF] shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-3">
            <div class="flex text-[#D97706] text-sm">★★★★★</div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-[#15803D] bg-green-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">✓ Verified Purchase</span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-serif text-base font-bold text-[#1F1B17] mb-2">“Best product - looks even nicer in person”</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#655E56] leading-relaxed">
            Beautiful and well-made wooden decoration! The quality is excellent, and it looks even nicer in person than in the photos. It was easy to assemble, feels sturdy, and adds a cozy, natural touch to my home decor. Definitely recommend!
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-[#EADFCF] flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
          <span class="font-bold text-[#1F1B17]">Александра Рогачева</span>
          <span class="text-[#8C827A]">August 2, 2026</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Review CTA -->
    <div class="mt-12 text-center">
      <a href="#MenvelBuySection" class="menvel-btn-primary max-w-xs mx-auto js-scroll-to-buy">
        Order Your Trivet Set
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

